Hi,

I update panasonic hotkey driver.
Now other discussion about key input event related hotkey,
then this version of driver is one answer.

*new features
 - generate normal key input event added to acpi event
   this is useful for volume up/down and mute.
   this hotkeys utility, you can show fancy gui.

This enhancdment is based on Ryuta Nakanishi's work.

You can get driver source from http://www.da-cha.org/letsnote/

*future plan
 - support Fn sticky mode.

Thanx.
